<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>{% block subject %}OnlyRoll{% endblock %}</title>
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #1a1a2e;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;
            color: #e2e8f0;
        }
        .wrapper {
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            background-color: #1e2235;
            border-radius: 12px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #2d3561;
        }
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6d28d9, #4f46e5);
            padding: 32px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .header h1 {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #ffffff;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }
        .header p {
            margin: 4px 0 0;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);
        }
        .body {
            padding: 40px;
        }
        .body p {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #cbd5e1;
            margin: 0 0 16px;
        }
        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 24px 0;
            padding: 14px 32px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #6d28d9, #4f46e5);
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .cta-button:hover {
            opacity: 0.9;
        }
        .url-fallback {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #64748b;
            word-break: break-all;
            background: #0f172a;
            padding: 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }
        .footer {
            border-top: 1px solid #2d3561;
            padding: 24px 40px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .footer p {
            margin: 0;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #475569;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrapper">
    <div class="header">
        <h1>OnlyRoll</h1>
        <p>La plateforme de jeu de rôle en ligne</p>
    </div>
    <div class="body">
        {% block body %}{% endblock %}
    </div>
    <div class="footer">
        <p>© {{ "now"|date("Y") }} OnlyRoll — Cet email a été envoyé automatiquement, merci de ne pas y répondre.</p>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
